+# SDL_GPU device lifecycle and production audits — 2026-10-20
+
+Patch 2471 introduced `SDL3GpuDeviceOwner` for SDL_GPU ownership. Patch 2472
+also uses it in the production graphics-pipeline audit. Disposal waits for GPU
+idle, reports a failed wait, and destroys the device; nested cleanup still
+releases the hidden window and quits SDL if device disposal fails.
+
+## Build
+
+```text
+DOTNET_ROOT=/opt/dotnet-10 DOTNET_ROOT_X64=/opt/dotnet-10 \
+  /opt/dotnet-10/dotnet build src/lancer/lancer.csproj -c Release \
+  --no-restore -p:UseSharedCompilation=false
+Build succeeded.
+167 Warning(s)
+0 Error(s)
+```
+
+## Shader compilation
+
+```text
+SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen SDL_GPU_DRIVER=vulkan \
+  DOTNET_ROOT=/opt/dotnet-10 DOTNET_ROOT_X64=/opt/dotnet-10 timeout 90s \
+  /opt/dotnet-10/dotnet src/lancer/bin/Release/net10.0/lancer.dll \
+  --sdl-gpu-shader-compile-audit
+Installed Vulkan doesn't implement the VK_EXT_headless_surface extension
+MESA-INTEL: warning: Haswell Vulkan support is incomplete
+SDL_GPU shader audit driver: vulkan
+SDL_GPU production shader compile audit passed: 26 bundles, 3495 variants, 6990 shader stages.
+```
+
+## Production pipeline creation
+
+```text
+SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen SDL_GPU_DRIVER=vulkan \
+  DOTNET_ROOT=/opt/dotnet-10 DOTNET_ROOT_X64=/opt/dotnet-10 timeout 150s \
+  /opt/dotnet-10/dotnet src/lancer/bin/Release/net10.0/lancer.dll \
+  --sdl-gpu-production-pipeline-audit
+Installed Vulkan doesn't implement the VK_EXT_headless_surface extension
+MESA-INTEL: warning: Haswell Vulkan support is incomplete
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit driver: vulkan
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit passed: 26 bundles, 3495 pipelines created and released.
+```
+
+The Vulkan driver reports incomplete Haswell support. The audits prove shader
+and pipeline object creation and cleanup on this driver only. They do not draw
+or read back the complete game scene. `SDL3Game` still creates
+`GLRenderContext`; the production game and editor renderers are not running on
+SDL_GPU yet.
